# MySQL HR & Sales SQL Practice Project

Q1. Find the second highest salary from the employees table.

```sql
SELECT MAX(salary)
FROM employees
WHERE salary < (SELECT MAX(salary) FROM employees);
```

### Q2. Find the third highest salary using DENSE_RANK.

```sql
SELECT salary
FROM (
SELECT salary,
DENSE_RANK() OVER (ORDER BY salary DESC) AS salary_rank
FROM employees
) ranked
WHERE salary_rank = 3;
```

### Q3. Find employees whose salary is greater than the average salary.

```sql
